sequenceDiagram
 participant UI
 participant API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant Worker
 participant Meta
 UI->>API: Open conversation
 API->>DB: Read snapshot
 DB-->>API: Data and observed time
 API-->>UI: Saved messages or explicit missing state
 Note over Worker,Meta: Independent refresh, cooldown respected
 Worker->>Meta: Read batch
 Meta-->>Worker: Response or rate limit
 Worker->>DB: Save successful response
